---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import { tools } from "~/components/sections/data";
---

<section
   class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl scroll-mt-24 px-5 pt-32 lg:px-12 lg:pt-40"
   id="statement"
   aria-labelledby="statement-title"
>
   <div
      class="flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-faint"
   >
      <span class="text-acid">02</span><span class="h-px w-7 bg-acid"
      ></span>Point of view
   </div>
   <div class="mt-8 grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-end lg:gap-20">
      <h2
         id="statement-title"
         class="font-display text-5xl font-semibold uppercase leading-none tracking-normal text-ink sm:text-7xl lg:text-8xl"
      >
         AI is the multiplier.<br /><span class="text-muted"
            >Judgement is the job.</span>
      </h2>
      <div class="pb-1">
         <ul
            class="mb-11 grid grid-cols-2 border-l border-t border-line-soft sm:grid-cols-4"
            aria-label="Tools I work with"
         >
            {
               tools.map(
                  (tool) =>
                     tool.logo && (
                        <li class="group flex aspect-3/2 items-center justify-center border-b border-r border-line-soft px-4 py-3 transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-void-soft">
                           <Image
                              src={tool.logo}
                              alt={`${tool.name} logo`}
                              width={320}
                              height={213}
                              densities={[1, 2]}
                              loading="lazy"
                              decoding="async"
                              class="tool-logo h-full w-full scale-110 object-contain opacity-75 transition-all duration-500 ease-out group-hover:scale-115 group-hover:opacity-100"
                           />
                        </li>
                     ),
               )
            }
         </ul>
         <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">
            The tool can give me ten directions. My work is knowing which one
            has a pulse, then carrying it all the way from the first line of
            copy to the final frame.
         </p><div
            class="mt-9 flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-faint"
         >
            <span class="h-px w-8 bg-acid"></span>Think / direct / make / learn
         </div>
      </div>
   </div>
</section>

<style>
   /* Source logos are dark marks on a white background. Grayscale + invert
      flips them to white on black, and screen blending drops the black so the
      mark sits directly on the page instead of inside a bright white card. */
   .tool-logo {
      filter: grayscale(1) invert(1) contrast(1.1);
      mix-blend-mode: screen;
   }
</style>
